#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:5
msgid "Xavier: KV Cache Sharing"
msgstr "Xavier：KV 缓存共享"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:6
msgid "Xavier enables KV cache sharing between model replicas, with adapters for vLLM, SGLang, TRT-LLM and MLX. Replicas of the same engine can reuse compatible prefix caches to reduce repeated prefill computation for long prompts and multi-turn conversations."
msgstr "Xavier 通过 vLLM、SGLang、TRT-LLM 和 MLX 适配器在模型副本间共享 KV 缓存。同一引擎的副本可以复用兼容的前缀缓存，减少长提示词和多轮对话中重复的 prefill 计算。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:15
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:16
msgid "Launch multiple replicas with ``enable_xavier=True`` and select a supported ``model_engine``. See :ref:`user_guide_backends` for engine requirements and :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation` for P/D deployment."
msgstr "启动多个副本时设置 ``enable_xavier=True``，并选择支持的 ``model_engine``。引擎要求请参见 :ref:`user_guide_backends`，P/D 部署请参见 :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:21
msgid ""
"Xavier requires vllm version >= ``0.7.0``, and currently not supports for"
" vllm version >= ``0.11.0`` due to vllm reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"Xavier 要求 vllm 版本不低于 ``0.7.0`` 。暂不支持vllm 版本高于 ``0.11.0``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:22
msgid ""
"Due to the underlying communication not recognizing ``0.0.0.0``, the "
"actual IP address needs to be passed when starting Xinference, for "
"example: ``xinference-local -H 192.168.xx.xx``."
msgstr ""
"由于底层通信无法识别 ``0.0.0.0`` 地址，启动 xinference 时需要配置实际的 "
"IP 地址，例如：``xinference-local -H 192.168.xx.xx`` 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:23
msgid "The vLLM GPU transfer path requires NVIDIA GPUs."
msgstr "vLLM GPU 传输路径需要 NVIDIA GPU。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "SGLang replicas"
msgstr "SGLang 副本"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "SGLang >= ``0.5.21`` can share prefix KV cache through Xavier's HiCache storage backend. Launch multiple replicas with ``model_engine=\"SGLang\"`` and ``enable_xavier=True``. The initial adapter supports unquantized FP16 Qwen2, Qwen3 and Llama text models with full attention and TP=PP=DP=1; LoRA, speculation, hybrid attention and multimodal inputs are unsupported."
msgstr "SGLang >= ``0.5.21`` 可通过 Xavier 的 HiCache 存储后端共享前缀 KV 缓存。启动多个副本时设置 ``model_engine=\"SGLang\"`` 和 ``enable_xavier=True``。初始适配器支持使用全注意力、未量化 FP16 权重且 TP=PP=DP=1 的 Qwen2、Qwen3 和 Llama 文本模型；不支持 LoRA、推测解码、混合注意力和多模态输入。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "``xavier_cache_bytes`` sets the deployment's shared CPU cache budget (default: ``536870912``, 512 MiB). Each SGLang replica also allocates its own GPU and HiCache host pools. Eviction or unavailable storage becomes a cache miss for ordinary replicas. Cache namespaces include the actual weights, tokenizer, model configuration, KV geometry and engine format; caches cannot yet be exchanged between vLLM and SGLang."
msgstr "``xavier_cache_bytes`` 设置部署的共享 CPU 缓存预算（默认 ``536870912``，即 512 MiB）。每个 SGLang 副本还会分配自己的 GPU 和 HiCache 主机内存池。对于普通副本，缓存淘汰或存储不可用会作为缓存未命中处理。缓存命名空间包含实际权重、分词器、模型配置、KV 几何形状和引擎格式；目前还不能在 vLLM 与 SGLang 之间交换缓存。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "Ordinary SGLang replicas share CPU HiCache pages. Explicit prefill/decode roles use Xavier GPU-to-GPU transfer instead. For same-engine or cross-engine P/D and per-replica engine settings, see :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`."
msgstr "普通 SGLang 副本共享 CPU HiCache 页面。显式 prefill/decode 角色使用 Xavier GPU 直传。同引擎或跨引擎 P/D 及各副本的引擎配置方式见 :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。"

#: ../../user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "Xavier loads BF16 checkpoints as FP16 and emits a warning. Both weights and KV caches use FP16."
msgstr "Xavier 将 BF16 检查点加载为 FP16 并发出警告。权重和 KV 缓存均使用 FP16。"

#: user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst
msgid "MLX replicas"
msgstr "MLX 副本"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:18
msgid "For attention-only models on vLLM V1, Xavier preserves the model's ``enforce_eager`` setting, allowing CUDA Graph execution. Set ``enforce_eager=True`` at model launch to use eager execution. Recurrent models continue to use eager execution by default."
msgstr "对于 vLLM V1 上仅使用注意力层的模型，Xavier 保留模型的 ``enforce_eager`` 设置，允许使用 CUDA Graph 执行。若要使用 eager 执行，请在启动模型时设置 ``enforce_eager=True``。循环模型仍默认使用 eager 执行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:52
msgid "Request-scoped cache isolation"
msgstr "按请求隔离缓存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:54
msgid ""
"Pass ``cache_salt`` with each inference request to isolate prefix-cache "
"reuse. Requests with the same salt can reuse compatible caches across "
"replicas; different salts cannot reuse each other's cached prefixes. This "
"covers the local engine cache, Xavier shared caches and retained history, "
"and same-engine or cross-engine P/D for vLLM, SGLang and MLX. Both P/D roles"
" receive the same salt; incompatible cache scopes are rejected before "
"importing KV."
msgstr ""
"在每次推理请求中传入 ``cache_salt``，即可隔离前缀缓存复用。同一 salt 的请求可以跨副本复用兼容缓存；不同 salt "
"无法复用彼此的前缀缓存。这涵盖 vLLM、SGLang 和 MLX 的引擎本地缓存、Xavier 共享缓存和历史缓存，以及同引擎和跨引擎 P/D。P/D"
" 两端接收同一 salt；缓存作用域不一致时，会在导入 KV 前拒绝请求。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:56
msgid ""
"With the Xinference Python client, include ``cache_salt`` in "
"``generate_config``. With the OpenAI client, use ``extra_body``:"
msgstr ""
"使用 Xinference Python 客户端时，将 ``cache_salt`` 放入 ``generate_config``。使用 OpenAI "
"客户端时，使用 ``extra_body``："

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:66
msgid ""
"The same top-level field is accepted by the Completions, Chat Completions, "
"Responses and Anthropic Messages endpoints, for streaming and non-streaming "
"inference. A salt must be a nonempty string of at most 256 characters "
"without control characters. Unsupported model engines reject salted requests"
" rather than ignoring the field. Legacy vLLM V0 requires Xavier to use "
"salts."
msgstr ""
"Completions、Chat Completions、Responses 和 Anthropic Messages "
"端点均接受这一顶层字段，支持流式和非流式推理。salt 必须为不含控制字符的非空字符串，最多 256 个字符。不支持的模型引擎会拒绝带 salt "
"的请求，不会忽略该字段。旧版 vLLM V0 需要启用 Xavier 才能使用 salt。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:68
msgid ""
"Choose a stable, unguessable salt for each intended sharing boundary. A "
"trusted application or gateway should authenticate callers, derive the salt "
"from its own customer identity, and overwrite any client-supplied salt. "
"Xinference does not map salts to users or create a tenant database. Salt "
"knowledge permits cache sharing within that scope; client-selected salts "
"alone do not enforce customer identity."
msgstr ""
"为每个预期共享边界选择稳定且不可猜测的 salt。可信应用或网关应验证调用方身份，根据自身掌握的客户身份派生 salt，并覆盖客户端传入的 "
"salt。Xinference 不会将 salt 映射到用户，也不会建立租户数据库。知道 salt 即可在该作用域内共享缓存；仅由客户端选择 salt "
"无法保证客户身份隔离。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:70
msgid ""
"Without a salt, requests keep the existing shared-cache behavior. Set "
"``XINFERENCE_REQUIRE_CACHE_SALT=1`` in the API server environment to reject "
"inference requests without a salt; the default is ``0``. Enable this policy "
"after all callers or an API extension supply salts. The policy applies to "
"the four inference endpoints above and does not disable prefix caching."
msgstr ""
"不传 salt 时，请求保持现有共享缓存行为。在 API 服务环境中设置 "
"``XINFERENCE_REQUIRE_CACHE_SALT=1``，即可拒绝未带 salt 的推理请求；默认值为 ``0``。所有调用方或 API "
"扩展提供 salt 后再启用该策略。此策略适用于上述四类推理端点，不会禁用前缀缓存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:72
msgid ""
"Distribution wrappers can supply an authoritative salt through the optional "
"synchronous ``cache_salt(request)`` extension hook, returning "
"``xinference.extensions.CacheSalt(value)``. The hook runs after model-access"
" checks and may read identity prepared by authenticated API dependencies "
"from ``request.state``. Its result overrides the request field. Configure "
"the extension through ``XINFERENCE_EXTENSIONS``; provider failures, missing "
"return values and multiple providers reject the request without falling back"
" to the client salt. When no provider is configured, the request field is "
"used. Extension hooks must remain non-blocking."
msgstr ""
"发行版封装可以通过可选的同步扩展钩子 ``cache_salt(request)`` 提供权威 salt，返回 "
"``xinference.extensions.CacheSalt(value)``。此钩子在模型访问检查后运行，可从 "
"``request.state`` 读取已由经过身份验证的 API 依赖项准备的身份。返回值覆盖请求字段。通过 "
"``XINFERENCE_EXTENSIONS`` 配置扩展；提供方失败、未返回值或存在多个提供方时，拒绝请求，不回退到客户端 "
"salt。未配置提供方时使用请求字段。扩展钩子必须保持非阻塞。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:74
msgid ""
"Cache salting limits prefix-cache timing inference across sharing "
"boundaries. It does not provide separate model processes, memory quotas or "
"complete timing-side-channel isolation. Changing a salt starts a new cache "
"scope; existing entries remain subject to normal eviction."
msgstr ""
"缓存加盐可限制跨共享边界的前缀缓存计时推断。它不提供独立模型进程、内存配额或完整的计时侧信道隔离。更换 salt "
"会创建新的缓存作用域；原有条目仍按正常规则淘汰。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:31
msgid "Storage backends"
msgstr "存储后端"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:34
msgid "``xavier_cache_backend=\"native\"`` is the default and keeps the existing CPU and GPU cache behavior. The optional ``lmcache`` backend adds disk-backed prefix reuse for ordinary vLLM V1, SGLang and TRT-LLM replicas. Install ``xinference[xavier-lmcache]`` in the Linux environment hosting storage: each vLLM transfer actor's environment, or the supervisor environment for SGLang and TRT-LLM. Model environments can remain separate. This adapter targets LMCache >= ``0.5.6`` and < ``0.6`` with its native FS extension, and Python 3.10 through 3.13."
msgstr "``xavier_cache_backend=\"native\"`` 为默认值，保持现有 CPU 和 GPU 缓存行为。可选的 ``lmcache`` 后端为普通 vLLM V1、SGLang 和 TRT-LLM 副本提供磁盘前缀缓存复用。在托管存储的 Linux 环境中安装 ``xinference[xavier-lmcache]``：vLLM 使用各传输 actor 的环境，SGLang 和 TRT-LLM 使用 supervisor 环境。模型环境可以独立配置。此适配器支持带原生 FS 扩展的 LMCache >= ``0.5.6`` 且 < ``0.6``，以及 Python 3.10 至 3.13。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:36
msgid "Select the backend when launching the model:"
msgstr "启动模型时选择后端："

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:57
msgid "``cpu_bytes`` bounds each LMCache instance's DRAM pool (default: 512 MiB). vLLM creates one instance per replica; SGLang and TRT-LLM share one supervisor-owned instance per deployment. ``disk_path`` must be absolute and local to that storage host, and ``disk_bytes`` is the positive disk capacity per instance. LMCache manages asynchronous writes, prefetch and eviction within these tiers. Disk eviction uses watermarks, so the configured disk capacity is not a filesystem quota. Xavier also uses bounded transient CPU staging and read copies, up to another ``2 * cpu_bytes`` per instance; engine KV pools, owned import buffers, serialization and transfer buffers consume additional memory."
msgstr "``cpu_bytes`` 限制每个 LMCache 实例的 DRAM 池（默认 512 MiB）。vLLM 为每个副本创建一个实例；SGLang 和 TRT-LLM 的每个部署共用一个 supervisor 托管的实例。``disk_path`` 必须是该存储主机本地的绝对路径，``disk_bytes`` 为每个实例的正数磁盘容量。LMCache 管理各层的异步写入、预取和淘汰。磁盘淘汰使用水位线，因此配置容量不是文件系统配额。Xavier 还使用有界的临时 CPU 暂存和读取副本，每个实例最多额外使用 ``2 * cpu_bytes``；引擎 KV 池、独立持有的导入缓冲区、序列化及传输缓冲区另占内存。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:59
msgid "``read_timeout`` bounds a cache lookup's wait in seconds (default: 30). Missing, unavailable or timed-out cache reads fall back to local prefill. At most one LMCache prefetch job runs per storage instance; a timed-out or cancelled job still releases its LMCache read locks. Reads exceeding the transient capacity return a bounded prefix or fall back to local prefill. Compare TTFT and read latency against prefill cost for your workload."
msgstr "``read_timeout`` 限制缓存查找的等待秒数（默认 30）。缓存缺失、不可用或读取超时会回退到本地 prefill。每个存储实例最多运行一个 LMCache 预取任务；超时或取消后，任务仍会释放 LMCache 读取锁。超过临时容量的读取会返回有界前缀或回退到本地 prefill。请根据工作负载比较 TTFT、读取延迟和 prefill 成本。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:61
msgid "The LMCache backend requires multiple ordinary replicas of the same engine and preserves that engine's existing Xavier model, dtype and parallelism limits. P/D roles, legacy vLLM V0 and MLX are unsupported; P/D KV handoff remains a separate transport concern. Use backend ``cpu_bytes`` instead of the native ``xavier_cache_bytes`` or ``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes`` budgets. Backend selection does not enable cross-engine cache sharing or change existing cache-salt behavior. Each deployment and storage instance owns a separate namespace and directory; relaunching does not recover old entries. Graceful shutdown removes that directory; after a process crash, remove abandoned deployment directories when they are no longer in use."
msgstr "LMCache 后端要求同一引擎的多个普通副本，并保留该引擎现有的 Xavier 模型、dtype 和并行度限制。不支持 P/D 角色、旧版 vLLM V0 或 MLX；P/D KV 交接仍由独立的传输路径负责。请使用后端 ``cpu_bytes``，而非 native 的 ``xavier_cache_bytes`` 或 ``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes`` 预算。后端选择不会启用跨引擎缓存共享，也不会改变现有 cache-salt 行为。每个部署的每个存储实例拥有独立命名空间和目录；重新启动不会恢复旧条目。正常关闭会删除该目录；进程崩溃后，请在确认不再使用时清理遗留的部署目录。"

#: source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:34
msgid "LMCache storage for ordinary vLLM V1, SGLang and TRT-LLM replicas."
msgstr "面向普通 vLLM V1、SGLang 和 TRT-LLM 副本的 LMCache 存储后端。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:13
msgid "Choose a deployment mode"
msgstr "选择部署模式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use ordinary replicas to share compatible prefixes while each replica "
"handles complete requests. Shared prefix caching currently stays within the "
"same engine. For separate prefill and decode roles, including cross-engine "
"and CUDA/Metal deployments, use :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`. P/D "
"transport and ordinary cache storage have separate configuration and "
"compatibility limits."
msgstr ""
"普通副本各自处理完整请求，同时共享兼容的前缀。前缀共享缓存目前限于同一引擎。若要分别部署 prefill 与 decode 角色，包括跨引擎和 "
"CUDA/Metal 部署，请参见 :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。P/D "
"传输和普通缓存存储各有独立的配置及兼容性限制。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:26
msgid ""
"The example launches two ordinary replicas. Choose the engine installed on "
"your workers; the model format and quantization must match it. Each CUDA "
"replica uses one GPU, while MLX runs on Apple silicon."
msgstr ""
"示例启动两个普通副本。请选择 worker 上已安装的引擎，并使用匹配的模型格式与量化选项。每个 CUDA 副本使用一张 GPU，MLX 则运行在 "
"Apple silicon 上。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:58
msgid "Engine requirements"
msgstr "引擎要求"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:64
msgid "vLLM"
msgstr "vLLM"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:69
msgid "V1 connector"
msgstr "V1 连接器"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:73
msgid ""
"The V1 connector requires vLLM >= ``0.21.0``, TP=1 and PP=1, with text-only "
"models and no LoRA. Multimodal and prompt-embedding inputs are unsupported. "
"Versions 0.11 through 0.20 are unsupported. Use the P/D guide for recurrent "
"model requirements and GPU history settings."
msgstr ""
"V1 连接器要求 vLLM >= ``0.21.0``、TP=1、PP=1，且仅支持无 LoRA 的文本模型。不支持多模态和 prompt "
"embedding 输入，也不支持 0.11 至 0.20 版本。循环模型要求和 GPU 历史缓存设置请参见 P/D 指南。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:86
msgid "Retained vLLM GPU history, configured with ``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes``."
msgstr "保留的 vLLM GPU 历史缓存，通过 ``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes`` 配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:89
msgid "Legacy V0 adapter"
msgstr "旧版 V0 适配器"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:91
msgid ""
"The legacy adapter supports vLLM >= ``0.7.0`` and < ``0.11.0`` for ordinary "
"replica cache sharing. Use the V1 connector for current P/D deployments."
msgstr ""
"旧版适配器支持 vLLM >= ``0.7.0`` 且 < ``0.11.0`` 的普通副本缓存共享。新的 P/D 部署请使用 V1 连接器。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:110
msgid "TRT-LLM replicas"
msgstr "TRT-LLM 副本"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:114
msgid ""
"TRT-LLM requires Linux/CUDA and ``tensorrt-llm==1.2.1``. Xavier supports "
"unquantized BF16 dense Qwen3 text models, one worker and one GPU per replica"
" (TP=PP=CP=1). Chunked prefill and overlap scheduling are disabled. "
"Quantization, hybrid attention, multimodal input, LoRA and speculative "
"decoding are unsupported with Xavier. See :ref:`trt_llm_backend` for the "
"engine environment requirements."
msgstr ""
"TRT-LLM 要求 Linux/CUDA 和 ``tensorrt-llm==1.2.1``。Xavier 支持未量化的 BF16 稠密 Qwen3 "
"文本模型，每个副本使用一个 worker 和一张 GPU（TP=PP=CP=1）。分块 prefill 和重叠调度会被禁用。Xavier "
"不支持量化、混合注意力、多模态输入、LoRA 和投机解码。引擎环境要求请参见 :ref:`trt_llm_backend`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:120
msgid ""
"Ordinary TRT replicas publish complete 64-token KV pages to a shared CPU "
"cache actor. ``xavier_cache_bytes`` sets the deployment budget (default: 512"
" MiB). Partial pages and the final prompt token are computed locally; misses"
" fall back to local prefill. Model weights, engine KV pools and transfer "
"buffers consume additional memory. Xavier P/D instead transfers live KV "
"pages through NIXL; see :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`."
msgstr ""
"普通 TRT 副本向共享 CPU 缓存 actor 发布完整的 64-token KV 页。``xavier_cache_bytes`` "
"设置部署缓存预算，默认 512 MiB。部分页和提示词的最后一个 token 在本地计算；未命中时执行本地 prefill。模型权重、引擎 KV "
"池和传输缓冲区额外占用内存。Xavier P/D 则通过 NIXL 传输请求中的 KV 页，详见 "
":ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:132
msgid ""
"MLX Xavier requires Apple silicon and ``mlx-lm>=0.31.2``. It supports "
"unquantized, full-attention Qwen2, Qwen3 and Llama text models with one "
"worker per replica. Weights and KV cache use FP16. Quantized weights or KV "
"cache, rotating caches, hybrid attention, multimodal inputs, LoRA and "
"speculative decoding are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"MLX Xavier 需要 Apple 芯片和 ``mlx-lm>=0.31.2``，支持采用全注意力的未量化 Qwen2、Qwen3 和 Llama "
"文本模型，每个副本使用一个 worker。权重和 KV 缓存使用 FP16。不支持量化权重或 KV 缓存、旋转缓存、混合注意力、多模态输入、LoRA "
"和推测解码。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:134
msgid ""
"``xavier_cache_bytes`` bounds the shared CPU cache (default: 512 MiB). Each "
"replica also owns its model and Metal KV cache. Ordinary replicas compute "
"locally on a miss or unavailable storage; incompatible deployments cannot "
"share pages. Returned usage reports reused tokens in "
"``prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens``. Explicit prefill/decode roles "
"enable MLX Xavier P/D automatically. Cross-engine cache sharing is not yet "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"``xavier_cache_bytes`` 限制共享 CPU 缓存容量，默认 512 MiB。每个副本还拥有各自的模型和 Metal KV "
"缓存。普通副本在未命中或存储不可用时本地计算；不兼容的部署不能共享缓存页。响应通过 "
"``prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens`` 报告复用 token 数。显式设置 prefill/decode "
"角色会自动启用 MLX Xavier P/D。目前不支持跨引擎缓存共享。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:140
msgid "Native storage"
msgstr "原生存储"

#: ../../source/user_guide/vllm_enhancement.rst:142
msgid ""
"The default ``xavier_cache_backend=\"native\"`` uses each engine's Xavier "
"cache implementation. ``xavier_cache_bytes`` sets the shared CPU budget for "
"SGLang, TRT-LLM and MLX; it is not a vLLM setting. vLLM's GPU history uses "
"``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes``. These budgets exclude weights, engine KV pools "
"and transfer buffers. Choose the engine above before sizing storage."
msgstr ""
"默认的 ``xavier_cache_backend=\"native\"`` 使用各引擎自己的 Xavier "
"缓存实现。``xavier_cache_bytes`` 设置 SGLang、TRT-LLM 和 MLX 的共享 CPU 预算，不适用于 "
"vLLM。vLLM GPU 历史缓存使用 ``xavier_gpu_cache_bytes``。这些预算不包括权重、引擎 KV "
"池和传输缓冲区。请先选择上面的引擎，再规划存储容量。"

